# Governance

- Shared memory is the durable store when `memory_repo.path` is configured.
- Local `config.toml` or workspace `.pamem/config.toml` owns repo location, sharing mode, and propagation behavior.
- `MEMORY.md` stays a thin index, not a transcript.
- Runtime startup hooks are read-only loaders; they do not repair or propagate shared memory.
- Propagation for the memory repo is handled through reviewed git merge plus normal pull/bootstrap.
- Any memory executor agent lives in the pamem plugin `agents/` directory, not in shared memory.
